        "func": "let temp = Number((Math.random() * 5 + 25).toFixed(1));\nlet hum = Number((Math.random() * 100).toFixed(1));\nlet water = Math.round(Math.random())\nlet smoke = Math.round(Math.random() * 1000)\nlet door = Math.round(Math.random())\nlet time = new Date()\n\nmsg.payload = { \n    \"temp\": temp,\n    \"hum\": hum,\n    \"water\": water,\n    \"smoke\": smoke,\n    \"door\": door,\n    \"time\": time \n};  \nreturn msg;",
